<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwe iwanu wa Kolosai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iwanu wa Kolosai</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa Wakiristu wa Kolosai tsayandikighwa na Mtumighwa Pauli (1:1). Tsakayandika ibaluwa ino hang'ali mwigheletsa ako Roma mne miyaka ya sitini kulawa Yesu helekighwe. Ibaluwa ino kwa Wakolosai, na ibaluwa kwa Waefeso na ibaluwa kwa Filimoni tsokemighwa tsibaluwa tsa mwigheletsa kwaapfila Pauli tsakatsandika hang'ali mwigheletsa. Tsakawandikila ibaluwa ino wakiristu wa Wakolosai mne ghumji ghwa Kolosai. Pauli ng'anzile bae likanisa ako Kolosai, ka pfalongile mne (2:1), lekeni tsakakala kolimanya likanisa lino. Lamda Epafula iyo yandusile kanisa lino kwaapfila tsaang'aili yolawila Kolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli yang'ali yakwalangula na malangulitso gha ughutsu ighawile mne kanisa lya Kolosai. Tsakatumila chipande chikulu kwandika mbuli ino. Wengi tsawakala wa kingili lya Wakiristu wa Chiyahudi iwang'ali woghetsa kunanaitsa Wakiristu wangi wawinze Ghamalaghitso gha Chiyahudi kulawa Laghano lya Ghumwande, ghendoghendo ukwingila ngoma. Pauli kandika mwatsi ghendo ka ili watogholighwe ne Imulungu, Wakiristu ng'awobama chinu chingi bae ila Kiristu yaliyeka (1:15-20) na ghamalangulitso igholawa kwe iwanu ghahela sang'ano (2:8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:1-2 Pauli kakwandusa ibaluwa yake kwa kuwalamsa Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:3-3:4 Kakwandika ukulu wa Kiristu, ghendoghendo mna ukwidika ghamalangulitso ghe ughutsu ako Kolosai</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 3:5-4:6 Ka pfaili mna tsibaluwa tsake tsingi, Pauli kakwandika malaghitso Wakiristu pfawabamighwa kukala.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 4:7-18 Pauli komalitsila kwa kuwalamsa keli na kulaghitsa ibaluwa isomighwe hambele he iwanu mna ghamakanisa ghangi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Pauli, imtumighwa wa Yesu Kiristu kwa unoghelo we Imulungu, hamwe na ndughu yetu Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Twomwandikilani mwemwe wandughu wenzeluka na wenyepfale yamwilungile na Kiristu yamkala Kolosai, ndughu tsetu imumtoghole Kiristu, Imulungu Aba wetu yamtendeleni uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kowalombela Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghose hatumlombelani twolonga mighede kwe Imulungu, Aba we Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>mana tsatuhulika pfamumtoghola Kiristu Yesu na pfamuwanoghela iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Unoghelo na inoghola yenu pfohuwila lolelo lila lyamwikilighwe kulanga, achila chamuhulike ghumwande kwa kupetelighwa Imbuli Inoghile ya kweli, <verse number="6" style="v"/>iiwapfikile mwemwe, ka pfayenele mne iisi yose no ukughala ghanoghile, no ukukula ka pfaitenda mghati mwenu kulawa litsuwa lila lyamuihulike na kumanya uluso we Imulungu pfauli. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tsamlangulitsighwa uluso we Imulungu na Epafura, mtenda sang'ano miyetu mnoghelighwa, msang'ana iyanoghile wa Kiristu kwaajili yetu, <verse number="8" style="v"/>naye tsakatulongela unoghelo wamwing'ighwe ne Ghumuhe we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaajili ayo, kulawa hatuhulike mbuli tsenu, ng'atulekile bae kuwalombela. Twomlomba Imulungu yawatende mwemwe mmanye ghoya aghala ghayobama, ne inzewele yose ne ukumanya kwamwing'ighwe ne Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Twolomba apfi ili mdahe kukala ka Imtwatsa pfayobama, mghendelele kutenda ighomnoghela yeye. Mweleke chila ghamatunda ghanoghile, mkule mne ukummanya Imulungu, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Imulungu yamwing'eni ngupfu kwa uwetso wake wose mkulu ili mdahe kududumila ghose bila kwipfa, <verse number="12" style="v"/>na kwa kudeng'elela mumlongele mighede Aba iyawatendile mdahe kubokela uhala we iwahenzeluka mne undewa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naye katukombola kulawa mne ingupfu ya chisi, katughala mne undewa we Imwanaghe iyomnoghela, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kubitila yeye twokombolighwa, twoleghusighwa nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristu na isang'ano yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiristu yatumwonile keghala ghendo ne Imulungu ing'akoneka bae. Yeye tsakabaho ng'ana pfilumbe pfose pfilumbighwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kubitila yeye Imulungu kalumba ipfinu pfose, ipfili kulanga ne ipfili muisi, ipfikoneka ne ing'apfikoneka bae, iwane uwetso, iwatawala, iwakulu na iwane tsingupfu. Pfyose tsapfilumbighwa kubitila yeye na kwaajili yake. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristu tsakabaho ng'ana ipfinu pfose pfilumbighwe, na mne ukwilunga na Kiristu ipfinu pfose pfekindisa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yeye ka litwi lya lukuli, lukuli alwo iwo iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu, yeye ka wa mwanduso. Yeye ka wa mwanduso kutsilihuka, ili yawe wa mwanduso mne ipfinu pfose. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mana Imulungu tsakanoghelighwa ukutimila kwake kwose kuwe mghati mwa Kiristu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kubitila mwanaghe, Imulungu tsakalamla pfose ipfilumbighwe pfimuyile, na kwa idamu yake ghwitike mne msalaba katenda tindiwalo na ipfinu pfose muisi na kulanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Aho mwanduso mwemwe namwe tsamkala kutali ne Imulungu, kuya tsamkala wanebe wake kwapfila tsamwipfikitsa ghehile na tsamtenda ghehile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi, Imulungu kamtendani mwemwe muwe sale tsake kubitila lifwa lya lukuli lwe Imwanaghe, ili yamghaleni mwemwe hambele hake, aku mwa wahenzeluka, mnogha, na mwahela ghamatotso. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwobamighwa kughendelela ne ukwikindilisa mne ukutoghola, mleke kutoghola kuhighisighwa kulawa mne lolelo lila lyampatile hala hamuhulike Imbuli Inoghile. Nene Pauli nendighwa niwe mtumwa we Imbuli ayo Inoghile iipetighwe kwe iwanu wose mne iisi yose.</para>
  <para style="s">Isang'ano ya Pauli kwa iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Sambi nodeng'elela kwa aghala ghaniwadununzikilani, nolumemesa lukuli lwangu aghala ighahunguke mne maghayo gha Kiristu kwaajili ya lukuli lwake, iuli iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na nene nendighwa na Imulungu niwe mtumwa we iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu. Ning'ighwa sang'ano ya kuwalongela imbuli yake pfinoghile ghendo, <verse number="26" style="v"/>imbuli ayo iyo ila iipfisighwe kwe iwanu wose kulawa ghumwande, lekeni sambi ighubulighwa kwe iwanu wake. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakanoghelighwa kuwatenda iwanu wake wamanye utajiri na ukulu we imbuli ino mghati mwe isi tsose, nayo iyo ino, Kiristu ka mghati mwenu, namwe mtsokuwa mne utunitso iulolelighwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apfo twompeta Kiristu, kwa inzewele yose, twomkanya na kumlangulitsa imunu wowose ili tudahe kumghala chila imunu hambele he Imulungu aku kakomala mna ukwilunga na Kiristu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa kupeta mbuli ayo nene noidununzikila aku notumila ingupfu ng'ulu ya Kiristu iisang'ana mghati mwangu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nobama mpfimanye pfanisang'ana ng'ani kwaajili yenu, na kwaajili ye iwanu wa Laodikiya na kwaajili ye iwanu wangi ing'awatingane bae na nene. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Notenda apfi ili waghumighwe ghumoyo na welunge mna unoghelo ili wamemesighwe ukumanya kweli, wadahe kumanya ghendo imbuli ye Imulungu, imbuli ayo iyo Kiristu imwenyegho. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mna yeye upfisighwa utajiri wose we inzewele no ukumanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nowalongelani apfi ili imunu wowose aleke kuwaghutsukilani kwa mbuli tse ughutsu, hata ka tsakoneka tsinogha ng'ani. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mana hata ka nene nakutali namwe, ghumoyo ghwangu ghwa baho hamwe na mwemwe, na nodeng'elela kuwonani mwemwe pfamkwima mna ukumtoghola Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ughima mna kwilunga na Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lelo ka pfamumtoghole Yesu Kiristu ka Imtwatsa, mghendelele kwilunga naye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwike imitsitsi mghati mwake, na ughima wenu utsengeke mchanya mwake na mkindise inoghola ka pfamlangulitsighwe, namwe mlonge mighede.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwalangitse imunu aleke kuwatenda watumwa kwa ghamalangulitso gha hela, gha ughutsu uliyeka, ighahuwila mabokelo ghe iwanu ne ipfinyamkela iwotawala, na wala si aghala igholawa kwa Kiristu imwenyegho bae! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mghati mwa Kiristu, mlukuli mwake kwokala ukutimila kwose kwe Imulungu, <verse number="10" style="v"/>namwe mwing'ighwa ughima iutimile kwa ukwilunga naye. Yeye ka mchanya mwa ipfinyamkela wose iwotawala na iwakulu wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mne ukwilunga na Kiristu mwemwe mwingila ngoma kwa kuutsula unu wa nzambi, lekeni si ukwingila ngoma ikutendighwa ne iwanu, ila ikutendighwa ne Kiristu imwenyegho. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hambatitsighwe, tsamtsikighwa hamwe na Kiristu, na mne ubatitso mwemwe pfipfila mtsilihulighwa kwa kutsitoghola ngupfu tse Imulungu, iyamtsilihule Yesu kulawa mne lifwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Namwe tsamkala mfa kwaajili ya nzambi tsenu, na kwaapfila unu wenu wa nzambi tsang'auleghusighwe bae. Lekeni sambi Imulungu kawatenda mwemwe muwe wa ghima hamwe na Kiristu. Imulungu katuleghusila nzambi tsetu tsose, <verse number="14" style="v"/>hayamalitse kuileghusa hati ila iyandikighwe na ghamalaghitso gha kutuhigha twetwe, kaileghusa ghendo, kaiwamba mna msalaba. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mna ghumsalaba aghwo Kiristu tsakawaboka ngupfu awo ipfinyamkela iwotawala ne iwakulu, kawaghela chinyala hambele he iwanu kwa kuwakwegha ka iwaghoghighwe mng'ondo kulangusa kawahuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lelo mleke kutoghola imunu wowose yawekele malaghitso mne ichijo au choukunwa, au mne ichihungo au kwa ukulawa kwa ghumwetsi, au kwa Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ipfinu apfo pfa ichimbeho che ipfinu ipfikutsa, ukweli wenyegho iyo Kiristu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mleke kutoghola kuhighighwa ne imunu wowose iyebona kanogha kwa aghala ghaghonile ghaliheka na iyokomangitsa uenyepfale we ughutsu na kuwatamanila wamalaika, imunu ka ayo keghoda kwaajili ya pfinu pfayonile na kwaajili ya mbutsi tsake, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kaleka ukwikinda na Kiristu, iyali litwi lya lukuli, kubitila yeye lukuli lwose lwekinda na kulungighwa hamwe kwa pfilungo na nyughe yake, na lwokula ka Imulungu pfayobama.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa no kukala hamwe na Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mwemwe mfa hamwe na Kiristu na mkombolighwa kulawa mne ngupfu tsa ipfinyamkela iwatawala mne isi. Ebali lelo mwemwe mwokala ka mwa iwanu we isi ino? Ebali mwokinda malaghitso ka ghano, <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mleke kukinda achi, mleke kulanza achi, mleke kughusa achila”? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pfinu pfose apfo pfohinyika baho hapfitumika, agho malaghitso na ghamalangulitso ghe iwanu ghaliyeka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kweli malaghitso agho ghakoneka gha inzewele mne ukutamanila kwawetungile iwenyegho, na mne uenyepfale, na mne kulutawala lukuli kwa ukali, lekeni ghahela ingupfu ye ukughoma dong'o tse lukuli.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo ka mtsilihuka hamwe na Kiristu, mwipfikitse aghala ighali kulanga, akula kwayali Kiristu, ako kakala hanu ho ukutawala ubali we ukujilo we Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwipfikitse ipfinu ipfili kulanga, si ipfinu ipfili hano muisi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mana mwemwe tsamfa, na ughima wenu ufisighwa hamwe na Kiristu mghati mwe Imulungu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ughima wenu iyo Kiristu, na hayatsolawila keli, na mwemwe pfipfila mtsolawila hamwe naye mne utunitso.</para>
  <para style="s">Pfatukalile ghumwande na pfatukala sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo mchikome chila chinu chihile ichili mghati mwenu, ughoni na kutenda ghehile, dong'o na ghamawatso ghehile, na batsu ilighala ne ukutamanila ichinyagho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaajili ya agho ghose Imulungu katsowonela maya iwanu wose iwolema kumuhulikitsa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ghumwande mwemwe iwenyegho tsamkala pfipfo, hamng'ali mlongotsighwa na ghehile agho. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi mghaleke agha ghose, maya, soyoka no ukutenda ghehile. Mleke ukumligha Imulungu, na malonga ghehile ghaleke kulawa mne imilomo yenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kwighutsukila, kwaapfila mwemwe ma muutsula unu ula wa ghumwande hamwe na ghamatendo ghake ghehile ghose, <verse number="10" style="v"/>muupfala unu wa sambi. Unu awu woghendelela kutendighwa ghoya ne Imulungu iyaulumbile ili mwighale naye. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aho haduhu Mgiriki wala Myahudi, iyengile ngoma wala yang'engile ngoma, haduhu muhenza wala msenzi, mtumwa wala iyalekelighwe, ila Kiristu iyo ghose, naye kamumo mna ghose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwanu we Imulungu, yeye kawanoghela na kawasaghulani muwe wanu wake, lelo mpfale ghumoyo ghwa uluso, unu unoghile, wenyepfale, uhole na ukududumila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwidudumile na ukwileghusila ghamatotso, ka imunu kana imbuli ye kumsing'inikila imyaghe. Mwileghusile ghamatotso ka Imtwatsa pfayawaleghusileni. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kubita agha ghose, mwongetse unoghelo, kwaapfila unoghelo wakoha ghose mne umwe iutimile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tindiwalo lya Kiristu litawale mne imimoyo yenu. Kwaapfila Imulungu kawakema mwemwe kuwa ne tindiwalo alyo mne lukuli lumwe. Kuya mlongeghe mighede. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imbuli ya Kiristu imeme ghendo mghati mwenu. Mwilangulitse na mwikanye kwa inzewele yose, aku mwakwimba tsabuli na nyila tsa kumtunya Imulungu, akuno mwomwimbila Imulungu kwa kulonga mighede mne imimoyo yenu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na chochose chamtenda au chamlonga, chobamighwa chitendighwe kwa taghwa lya Imtwatsa Yesu, mumlongele mighede Aba Imulungu kubitila yeye.</para>
  <para style="s">Ughima wa sambi mne tsikaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwemwe wehe, muwahulikitse iwamale wenu, apfo pfipfo pfayobama Imtwatsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Namwe iwamale muwanoghele wehe wenu, mleke kuwa wakali kuna wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Namwe iwana muwahulikitse aba tsenu na mai tsenu mna ghose, mana apfo pfipfo pfaimnoghelesa Imtwatsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Namwe welesi mleke kuwaghobola iwanenu, hela watsobeneka ghumoyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Namwe iwatumwa muwahulikitse iwatwatsa wenu mna ghose, si hala hawomlolani haliyeka kwaapfila mwobama wamwoneni mnogha, ila mtende apfo kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile, kwa kumpfuka Imtwatsa Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chochose chamtenda, mchitende kwa ghumoyo ghwose, ka mwomtendela Imtwatsa Yesu, wala si imunu bae. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mkumbuke, Imtwatsa katsomwing'ani ghweko lyalikile kwaajili ye iwanu wake. Kiristu iyo Imtwatsa ghendo yamumtumikila. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila chila imunu iyotenda ghehile, katsobokela maliho ghe ukwiha kwake, mana Imulungu ng'obaghula bae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Namwe iwakulu muwatendele iwatumwa wenu pfinoghile na ka pfayobama Imulungu, mkumbuke ka namwe pfipfila mna Imtwatsa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso kwa Wakiristu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mumlombe Imulungu bila ukwipfa, na hamlomba mwalangitse na mlonge imighede kwe Imulungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pfipfila mtulombele na twetwe ili Imulungu atufughulile libani kwaajili ya mbuli yake ing'aimanyike, ili tudahe kulonga imbuli ya Kiristu. Kwaajili ya imbuli ayo sambi namchifungo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lelo mlombe ili nidahe kulonga ka pfanibamighwa, na imbuli ayo pfaitsokwikighwa mwatsimwatsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Muwe ne inzewele pfamkala ne iwanu ing'awomtoghola Kiristu, muitumile ghoya nyafwasi yamwinawo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghose mlonge ghanoghile na ighowapfila iwanu, kuya mmanye kuwedika ghoya iwanu wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa ukumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomtuma Tukiko kuna mwemwe, yeye ndughu mnoghelighwa, msang'ana mwenyepfale na imtumwa miyetu mne isang'ano ye Imtwatsa, katsomlongelani mbuli tsangu tsose. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomtuma kuna mwemwe ili awaghumeni ghumoyo kwa kuwalongela mbuli tsetu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kakutsa na Onesimo, ndughu yetu mnoghelighwa na mwenyepfale, ayo ka miyenu. Watsomwing'ani mbuli tse ipfinu pfose ipfitendeka hano. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Aristariko, yali mchifungo na nene, kowalamsani na Maliki, binamu yake Balinaba pfipfila kowalamsani. Ma tsampata malaghitso ghake, ang'apfika mumbokele. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naye Yoshua iyokemighwa Yusti kowalamsani. Mghati mwe Wayahudi iwabokele inoghola, hawano waliyeka iwosang'ana na nene kwaajili ya undewa we Imulungu, nawo wonguma ghumoyo ghendo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Epafura, mwenyekaye miyenu, mtumwa wa Yesu Kiristu komlamsani, ghamatsuwa ghose yeye ng'akwipfa bae kumlombelani ili mkomale, mwime ghendo na mghendelele kutoghola na kutenda ighamnoghela Imulungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nodaha kulapfa ukalangama ka kosang'ana ng'ani kwaajili ya mwemwe na kwaajili ye iwanu wa Laodikiya na awala iwali Hiyerapoli. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Luka, ayula mghanga wetu mnoghelighwa, na Dema womlamsani. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muwalamse iwandughu iwali Laodikiya, na Nimfa na iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu iwetingana mne ing'anda yake. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mng'amalitsa kuisoma ibaluwa ino, weng'eni na wayenu iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu wa Laodikiya nawo waisome, ne ibaluwa yaniwaandikile awala wa Laodikiya wamwing'eni mwemwe, namwe muisome. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na mumlongele Arikipo aitende ghoya isang'ano ila yeng'ighwe ne Imtwatsa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nene Pauli nakwandika ghano kwa ghumoko ghwangu mwenyegho kuwalamsani. Mkumbuke kuwa nene na mchifungo. Uluso we Imulungu ukale namwe.</para>
</usx>
